OL,3,GNEWSA'The Big Issue opened doors for me
OL,4,Awhen the world seemed unfriendly'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the Big Issue celebrates its 35th
OL,7,Fanniversary this September, the
OL,8,Fmagazine and social enterprise has been
OL,9,Fextremely successful in doing what its
OL,10,Fslogan suggests: it's still a "hand up
OL,11,Fnot a hand out".
OL,13,FIn London, currently there are around
OL,14,F616 people currently selling the Big
OL,15,FIssue, who have sold 358,000 copies in
OL,16,Fthe past year.
OL,18,FThree of them told BBC London how the
OL,19,FBig Issue had changed their life for
OL,20,Fthe better.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
