OL,3,GNEWSA'The Big Issue opened doors for me
OL,4,Awhen the world seemed unfriendly'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen it was first set up in London as
OL,7,Ffirst a monthly, then weekly magazine
OL,8,Fto help those facing street
OL,9,Fhomelessness, 64-year-old Kelvin
OL,10,FGregory, then in his 20s, was one of
OL,11,Fthe first to sign up.
